---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Beautychain Limited / MLM Lip"
  description="How MLM Lip (Beautychain Limited) collects, uses, stores and protects B2B inquiry data under GDPR and CCPA frameworks. Data controller contact and buyer rights."
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="note">Last updated: 22 November 2026 · Legal entity: {site.legalName} (operating the MLM Lip brand)</p>
      <p class="lead" style="max-width:680px">
        This policy explains what information we collect when you inquire about private label lip
        cosmetics manufacturing, how we use it, where it is stored, and the rights you have under the
        EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA).
        This site serves business customers (B2B) only.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tint" style="padding-top:32px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid two" style="align-items: start">

        <div class="card">
          <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            MLM Lip is the trading brand of <strong>{site.legalName}</strong>, a private label lip
            cosmetics manufacturer. For the purposes of GDPR, {site.legalName} is the data controller
            for personal data submitted through this website. Contact:
            <a href="mailto:privacy@mlmlip.com">privacy@mlmlip.com</a> (monitored mailbox — forwards to
            <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>).
          </p>
          <h2 style="margin-top:28px">2. What we collect</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            We only collect what you voluntarily submit through our inquiry forms (quote form,
            sample request, contact page, and the live chat lead box). The fields are:
          </p>
          <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.8; margin:12px 0 0;">
            <li>Your name</li>
            <li>Brand / company name</li>
            <li>Work email address</li>
            <li>WhatsApp / phone number (optional)</li>
            <li>Product interest, target quantity, target market / country</li>
            <li>Your project message / product brief</li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin:12px 0 0;">
            We also log your IP address and the page the inquiry was submitted from, solely for
            spam and abuse prevention. Analytics data is processed under our
            <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2>3. How we use it</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            Your data is used exclusively to:
          </p>
          <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.8; margin:12px 0 0;">
            <li>Reply to your manufacturing inquiry with a quotation or technical guidance</li>
            <li>Send you an inquiry confirmation email</li>
            <li>Continue the B2B conversation you initiated (follow-up on your project)</li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin:12px 0 0;">
            Legal basis (GDPR Art. 6(1)(b) and (f)): performance of a business relationship you
            initiated and our legitimate interest in responding to commercial inquiries. We do not
            sell, rent, or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.
          </p>
          <h2 style="margin-top:28px">4. Where it is stored and who can access it</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            Inquiry records are transmitted to our sales team via internal notification channels
            (email and enterprise messaging) and persisted in a <strong>Upstash (Redis) managed
            database</strong> hosted on EU/US cloud infrastructure. The website itself runs on
            <strong>Vercel</strong> servers. Access is limited to the {site.legalName} sales and
            technical staff who need it to answer your inquiry.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2>5. How long we keep it</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            Inquiry data is retained for up to <strong>24 months</strong> after our last exchange,
            so we can pick up ongoing projects where you left off, then deleted. If you become an
            active customer, relevant records are retained for the duration of the business
            relationship plus the period required by applicable accounting and tax law.
          </p>
          <h2 style="margin-top:28px">6. Your rights (GDPR / CCPA)</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            You have the right to:
          </p>
          <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.8; margin:12px 0 0;">
            <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
            <li>Have it corrected if it is inaccurate</li>
            <li>Have it deleted (right to erasure), subject to legal retention duties</li>
            <li>Receive a copy of your data in a portable format</li>
            <li>Object to processing or withdraw consent at any time</li>
            <li>Complain to your local supervisory authority (in the EU) or the California Attorney General (CCPA)</li>
          </ul>
          <p style="margin:12px 0 0;">
            To exercise any right, email <a href="mailto:privacy@mlmlip.com">privacy@mlmlip.com</a>.
            We respond within 30 days. We do not knowingly collect data from anyone under 18.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2>7. Data processors we rely on</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            To operate this site we use: <strong>Vercel</strong> (web hosting),
            <strong>Upstash</strong> (inquiry data persistence), <strong>Google Analytics</strong>
            (traffic statistics, see our <a href="/cookie-policy/">Cookie Policy</a>), and
            transactional email providers for inquiry confirmations. Each processes data only on
            our documented instructions under applicable data-processing agreements.
          </p>
          <h2 style="margin-top:28px">8. Security &amp; changes</h2>
          <p style="margin:0">
            Inquiries are transmitted over TLS and rate-limited to prevent abuse. We will post any
            change to this policy on this page with an updated date. Questions:
            <a href="mailto:privacy@mlmlip.com">privacy@mlmlip.com</a> or
            <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>.
            See also our <a href="/terms/">Terms of Service</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
